WEBVTT

00:03:00.711 --> 00:03:01.978
A thinker.

00:03:02.012 --> 00:03:03.313
(Laughter)

00:03:03.313 --> 00:03:04.581
Yes.

00:03:04.614 --> 00:03:05.882
(Applause)

00:03:08.385 --> 00:03:10.921
So when it came time for me
to take the stage

00:03:10.954 --> 00:03:14.925
and share with the entire
vacation Bible school,

00:03:14.958 --> 00:03:17.961
I introduced myself and I said,

00:03:17.994 --> 00:03:21.798
"When I grow up,
I'm going to be a thinker."

00:03:21.832 --> 00:03:24.334
There was some laughter, some giggles,

00:03:24.367 --> 00:03:29.339
but it was really the disapproving look
on the teacher's face that made me recant.

00:03:29.372 --> 00:03:30.807
And so I said really quickly,